### ===========================================
### API Tests - Okane Transfer Backend
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ===========================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@agentId = 100
@agencyId = 100

### ===========================================
### 1. CASH SESSION APIs
### ===========================================

### 1.1. Get current cash session for agent 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/current?agentId={{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.2. Open a new cash session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/open
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 100,
  "agencyId": 100,
  "openingBalance": 20000.00
}

### 1.3. Get all cash sessions for agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions?agentId={{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.4. Get operations for a specific session (session 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/100/operations
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.5. Get all operations for agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/operations?agentId={{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.6. Adjust current cash session (add money)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/current/adjustments?agentId={{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "reference": "Alimentation caisse - Test"
}

### 1.7. Close current cash session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/current/close?agentId={{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countedAmount": 17500.00
}

### ===========================================
### 2. PAYOUT / PAYMENT APIs
### ===========================================

### 2.1. Search transfer by reference code (TESTPAY1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/search/code/TESTPAY1
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.2. Search transfer by reference code (TESTPAY2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/search/code/TESTPAY2
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.3. Search transfers by beneficiary phone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/search/phone/+221771112233
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.4. Search transfers by beneficiary phone (alternative)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/search/phone/+221770001122
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.5. Pay a transfer (TESTPAY1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transferId": 100,
  "agentId": 100,
  "agencyId": 100,
  "beneficiaryIdentityNumber": "SN123456"
}

### 2.6. Pay a transfer (TESTPAY2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transferId": 102,
  "agentId": 100,
  "agencyId": 100,
  "beneficiaryIdentityNumber": "SN445566"
}

### 2.7. Get payment history for agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/history?agentId={{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.8. Get receipt for payment 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/100/receipt
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 3. TRANSFER APIs (General)
### ===========================================

### 3.1. Get all transfers for agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/transfers/agent/{{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### 4. HEALTH CHECK
### ===========================================

### 4.1. Simple health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

### ===========================================
### TEST SCENARIO: Complete Flow
### ===========================================

### STEP 1: Check if agent has an open session
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/current?agentId=100

### STEP 2: If no session, open one
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/open
# { "agentId": 100, "agencyId": 100, "openingBalance": 20000.00 }

### STEP 3: Search for a transfer to pay
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/search/code/TESTPAY1

### STEP 4: Pay the transfer
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/pay
# { "transferId": 100, "agentId": 100, "agencyId": 100, "beneficiaryIdentityNumber": "SN123456" }

### STEP 5: Check payment history
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/history?agentId=100

### STEP 6: Get receipt
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/payouts/{paymentId}/receipt

### STEP 7: View cash operations
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/operations?agentId=100

### STEP 8: Close the session at end of day
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/cash-sessions/current/close?agentId=100
# { "countedAmount": 17500.00 }
